# THE ORACLE PINS — the one place that names which legend-engine / legend-pure
# commits are the spec. Read by:
#   * .github/workflows/*.yml   — CI clones exactly these commits (shallow, by SHA)
#   * tools/oracle-roots.sh     — the local gate scripts FAIL if the checkout at
#                                 LEGEND_ENGINE_ROOT / LEGEND_PURE_ROOT sits on a
#                                 different commit (every "phantom regression" in
#                                 docs/GATES.md was a stale or divergent checkout)
#
# Bumping = the oracle-pin bump procedure (docs/GATES.md): move the local
# checkouts, update these two SHAs in the same commit as the re-pinned
# scoreboards, and run tools/diagnostics.sh (trigger 2).
#
# Plain KEY=VALUE, no quotes, no expansion — sourced by bash and parsed by CI.
LEGEND_ENGINE_REPO=finos/legend-engine
LEGEND_ENGINE_SHA=943d38b3dc21f7f70721ae5820e09162095889f3
LEGEND_ENGINE_DESCRIBE=legend-engine-4.137.0-36-g943d38b3dc2
LEGEND_PURE_REPO=finos/legend-pure
LEGEND_PURE_SHA=d00cfd5ba664168356877eab5e15daaf6e32803f
LEGEND_PURE_DESCRIBE=legend-pure-5.92.0-3-gd00cfd5ba
